WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:07,950
What are we talking about?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,760
We had such a happy chat, brother

3
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:11,160
Let's talk about the electricity store opposite.

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:13,080
The other side has been holding events to reduce prices before.

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,320
Now it suddenly returns to its original price

6
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:16,120
No one wants to buy from them at all

7
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,760
Isn't this Wang Dahai breaking up with his niece?

8
00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:19,560
Just close the electricity store.

9
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,940
How long will it take?

10
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:24,340
Wang Dahai also wants to rent out the store like before. Guess what?

11
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:26,020
In the past two days, several waves of people have come to watch TV.

12
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:28,100
Someone had wanted to capture it for a long time, but at the critical moment

13
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,140
Sister-in-law Wang will come over

14
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,740
Talk about Wang Dahai screwing us away

15
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:31,900
I just saw it too

16
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:33,380
Some people left directly after hearing this

17
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:34,860
Losing luck in doing business

18
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:39,920
It's not that easy to rent a house again. Xiaolin is at home, Mrs. Wang.

19
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:42,080
You just came back from outside, huh?
